.03192642331123352, 0.01577562652528286, 0.00789720006287098, -0.006611873395740986, 0.07014341652393341, -0.0472952239215374, -0.03822819143533707, 0.015063679777085781]}, {'chunk_id': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0_v1_c010', 'chunk_index': 10, 'chunk_type': 'text', 'text': 'FINO Payments Bank\nCode of Bank’s Commitment to Customers\n4.4. To deal quickly and sympathetically with things that go wrong by:\n• Correcting mistakes promptly and cancelling any bank charges that we apply by mistake\nand compensate you for any financial loss you may have incurred due to our mistake, in\nterms of our compensation policy.\n• Handling your complaints promptly.\n• Telling you how to take your complaint forward if you are still not satisfied.\n• Providing suitable alternative avenues to alleviate problems arising out of technological\nfailures.\n4.5. To treat all your personal information as private and confidential\n• We will treat all your personal information as private and confidential subject to matters\nmentioned in this code.\n4.6. To publicize the Code:\n• We will make available this Code at every branch and on our website.\n• Ensure that our staffs are trained to provide relevant information about the Code and to\neffectively put the Code into practice.', 'text_hash': '3623ffe8a3c0b45a7e2795ffe4d751b4', 'quality_score': 0.3192, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0', 'normalized_filename': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '5eddba6c22d2fe3b46db023ae68d5183a15cb235b4d6713a96971ab80c02520f', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 11, 'text_blocks': 11, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T11:59:00.255942', 'total_chars_post_clean': 44536}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T11:59:07.335642', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 6, 'chunk_index': 10, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.006928565911948681, 0.0429364070296287