04494202137]}, {'chunk_id': 'customer_grievance_policy_0_v1_c006', 'chunk_index': 6, 'chunk_type': 'text', 'text': '2. Regulatory Reference\nThe following key regulation is applicable to the current policy document.\nRegulator Regulation name Date Regulation code\nRBI Master Circular on 1st July 2015 RBI/2015-16/59\nCustomer Service in DBR.No.Leg.BC.\nBanks 21/09.07.006/2015-\n16\n3. Key Stakeholders and Roles\nThe focus of this document is to give the Bank employees and customers an insight into the\ngrievance redressal mechanism implemented in the Bank. The policy document highlights\nimportant points viz. complaint registration process, complaint management system, timeline for\nresolution, escalation matrix and the stakeholders entrusted with the task of implementing this\npolicy. We have charted out the key activities that need to be undertaken by the Bank to implement\nthis policy in its true spirit.\n1) Complaint Management System (CMS)\nThe Bank must have a robust CMS that is able to register, track and auto-escalate complaints', 'text_hash': '2c2e328a8f09fef7d5b74e2ac8458b74', 'quality_score': 0.364, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'customer_grievance_policy_0', 'normalized_filename': 'customer_grievance_policy_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '785b00f9107f2c85c2912b96e5e471adf57b5ee7ff067aac98d5142dd58ca60b', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 13, 'text_blocks': 13, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T11:59:41.082010', 'total_chars_post_clean': 30055}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T11:59:53.321368', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 4, 'chunk_index': 6, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.03361508250236511, 0.04173731803894043, -0.02276330627501011, 0.031908199191093445, 0.025190996006131172, -0.02994551509618759, -0.0009384731529280543, -0.03853847458958626, -0.0033562476746737957, 0.04247206449508667, 0.0012835862580686808, 0.013324522413313389, 0.12676391005516052, 0.02305