ll times and shall be monitored on daily basis. The staff too would be trained for handling\ncomplaints efficiently with an open mind and smiling face.\n• The system will also be used to deal with the issues relating to services provided by\nOutsourced Agencies and the bank will ensure that the respective outsourcing service\nproviders resolve customer issues expeditiously and effectively.', 'text_hash': 'd7aadfcdef3c73cf3c56b4fad78d36be', 'quality_score': 0.3064, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'customer_grievance_policy_0', 'normalized_filename': 'customer_grievance_policy_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '785b00f9107f2c85c2912b96e5e471adf57b5ee7ff067aac98d5142dd58ca60b', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 13, 'text_blocks': 13, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T11:59:41.082010', 'total_chars_post_clean': 30055}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T11:59:53.321368', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 7, 'chunk_index': 16, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.03235376626253128, 0.04647456482052803, -0.024034462869167328, 0.027635155245661736, 0.02082020603120327, -0.03795770928263664, -0.029707850888371468, -0.02725057490170002, 0.012371913529932499, -0.020926514640450478, -0.02611839398741722, -0.010304802097380161, 0.09523049741983414, 0.029378099367022514, -0.028358321636915207, -0.003188499016687274, 0.029542086645960808, -0.04319886490702629, 0.023884890601038933, -0.011724142357707024, 0.030263865366578102, -0.047453831881284714, 0.017628129571676254, -0.00901810172945261, 0.02379801869392395, -0.008730294182896614, -0.006787220016121864, 0.01086085569113493, -0.0010641810949891806, 0.06308459490537643, 0.029139559715986252, -0.020123189315199852, 0.03163651376962662, 0.022097615525126457, 0.017359839752316475, 0.03487030416727066, -0.019793355837464333, -0.03692330792546272, 0.025547876954078674, 0.05586521327495575, 0.02783978544175625, 0.03344784677028656, 0.014904027804732323, 0.0