ained adequately to competently handle all\ncustomer complaints.\nThe bank needs to provide the call center staff with access to the system. All unresolved\ncomplaints/ complaints that require Bank’s employee’s input needs to be escalated automatically\nthrough the system to higher authorities and the details of IGR mechanism will be made available\non the public domain through their website.\n5.3.5 Timeline for responding/resolving complaints\n• Fraud cases, Legal cases and cases which need retrieval of documents and exceptionally\nold records: 20 working days\n• Account Under Restriction Complaints : 7 working days\n• Unauthorized transaction complaints : 90 days\n• Account Opening/ Service Request: 15 working days\n• All Dispute related cases: TATs provided by NPCI Guidelines along with Buffer days for duly\nreview and closures are defined. Kindly refer Internal SOP of Customer Grievance for', 'text_hash': 'fe41d2d7f3b686f2da8dfd80b9cfd19e', 'quality_score': 0.316, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'customer_grievance_policy_0', 'normalized_filename': 'customer_grievance_policy_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '785b00f9107f2c85c2912b96e5e471adf57b5ee7ff067aac98d5142dd58ca60b', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 13, 'text_blocks': 13, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T11:59:41.082010', 'total_chars_post_clean': 30055}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T11:59:53.321368', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 8, 'chunk_index': 20, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.020915133878588676, 0.034696467220783234, -0.0061241257935762405, 0.03892002999782562, 0.02594839222729206, -0.04158564284443855, -0.0030313911847770214, -0.05391159653663635, 0.023418158292770386, 0.02863231860101223, -0.02161801978945732, -0.00783528108149767, 0.1271233707666397, 0.024273015558719635, -0.0442475900053978, -0.04548297077417374, 0.049111947417259216, -0.006420762278139591, 0.024231279268860817, -0.01066062599420547