e, race, gender, marital status, \nreligion, disability or financial status. 5. Information - Transparency \nYou can get information on interest rates, fees and charges through any one or more of the \nfollowing: \n• \nNotice Board in our branches. \n• \nContacting our branches / merchants / BC or help-lines. \n• \nOur website. \n• \nAsking our designated staff/help desk. \n• \nReferring to the Tariff Schedule at our branches / on our website.', 'text_hash': 'a579392ac7066e3370167bb436aed944', 'quality_score': 0.48319999999999996, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0', 'normalized_filename': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '5eddba6c22d2fe3b46db023ae68d5183a15cb235b4d6713a96971ab80c02520f', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 11, 'text_blocks': 11, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:14:57.818895', 'total_chars_post_clean': 44536}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:15:07.955650', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 17, 'chunk_index': 37, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.02148370072245598, 0.062364231795072556, -0.016957705840468407, 0.027872934937477112, 0.010162287391722202, -0.049987729638814926, -0.024527007713913918, -0.035006534308195114, 0.02166847139596939, 0.03547587990760803, 0.010917126201093197, -0.006856012158095837, 0.11031186580657959, 0.03228841722011566, -0.02944808453321457, -0.047978512942790985, 0.012457969598472118, -0.018463728949427605, 0.02887227199971676, -0.019135041162371635, 0.01851465366780758, -0.049095407128334045, 0.019762888550758362, -0.00273122638463974, 0.0335075743496418, -0.03729773685336113, -0.007336315233260393, 0.04574744030833244, -0.010627815499901772, 0.052112337201833725, 0.02092047408223152, -0.055577974766492844, 0.015588629990816116, 0.012869116850197315, 0.03244467452168465, 0.02566039003431797, 0.007428890094161034, -0.04701405018568039, 0.01910395920276642, 0.