d terms of reference of the committee\nis as per the approved Management Governance manual.\n• Branch level customer service committee (BLCSC):\n• This committee should be set up at the branch level to gather suggestions from the\ncustomers.\n• In order to encourage a formal channel of communication between the customers and the\nbank at the branch level, FINO will take necessary steps for strengthening the branch\nlevel committees with greater involvement of customers. It will be ensured that branch\nlevel committees include their customers too.\n• A comprehensive notice board will be displayed in Branch which will state that there will\nbe a Customer Meet on monthly basis. Customer may contact the branch staff for further', 'text_hash': '5522e8ab8db53c75bb234f1db063e2d4', 'quality_score': 0.3464, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'customer_grievance_policy_0', 'normalized_filename': 'customer_grievance_policy_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '785b00f9107f2c85c2912b96e5e471adf57b5ee7ff067aac98d5142dd58ca60b', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 13, 'text_blocks': 13, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:15:44.236550', 'total_chars_post_clean': 30055}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:15:58.185820', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 5, 'chunk_index': 9, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.011878486722707748, 0.03947031870484352, -0.01292071957141161, 0.02986948750913143, 0.04146392643451691, -0.022536080330610275, -0.045265015214681625, -0.04123688116669655, -0.006357638631016016, -0.016457075253129005, -0.027544362470507622, 0.004759303759783506, 0.10751203447580338, -0.002459254814311862, -0.03297031298279762, -0.02085140161216259, 0.022868221625685692, -0.022235186770558357, 0.06165347248315811, -0.0033392678014934063, 0.021944906562566757, -0.016490746289491653, 0.02530030347406864, -0.007583972532302141, 0.030983831733465195, -0.0036498047411441803, -0.03248114883899689, 0.03370432