h will be actioned/ monitored at HO.\n• The Bank shall ensure that all final written responses to customers contain the mandatory\nclause to make customers aware of their rights to approach the Banking Ombudsman.\n7', 'text_hash': 'd2f03aa5e4d1c5578ed86a976161c657', 'quality_score': 0.564, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'customer_grievance_policy_0', 'normalized_filename': 'customer_grievance_policy_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '785b00f9107f2c85c2912b96e5e471adf57b5ee7ff067aac98d5142dd58ca60b', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 13, 'text_blocks': 13, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:15:44.236550', 'total_chars_post_clean': 30055}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:15:58.185820', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 7, 'chunk_index': 19, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.021904708817601204, 0.03471936285495758, -0.02378917671740055, 0.02185281179845333, 0.023279527202248573, 0.009092257358133793, -0.0077406270429492, -0.041215281933546066, 0.024001862853765488, 0.01188600156456232, -0.0065144263207912445, 0.008906327188014984, 0.09011055529117584, 0.01346827857196331, -0.03518090397119522, -0.021411173045635223, 0.028398700058460236, -0.02361825853586197, 0.02464975416660309, -0.02005627565085888, 0.010795068927109241, -0.03339080139994621, 0.021014777943491936, -0.008947891183197498, 0.003188415663316846, 0.0022116561885923147, 0.0052649579010903835, 0.017512982711195946, -0.023885156959295273, 0.06535874307155609, 0.034512318670749664, 0.014064781367778778, 0.023138264194130898, 0.030765807256102562, 0.010370979085564613, 0.04494684189558029, -0.02526589296758175, -0.012618445791304111, 0.04559312388300896, 0.037687793374061584, 0.028594885021448135, -0.0021228946279734373, -0.015225407667458057, -0.04699525982141495, 0.02170868217945099, -0.04465869069099426, 0.04148528352379799, -0.003931235987693071, -0.0319397896528244, 0.011880691163241863, 0.024880031123757362, 0.04900