9, 0.014178442768752575, -0.0020892235916107893, 0.04275188967585564, -0.045753564685583115, -0.030240312218666077, 0.02195783704519272]}, {'chunk_id': 'customer_grievance_policy_0_v1_c024', 'chunk_index': 24, 'chunk_type': 'text', 'text': 'bank\n• Customer service committee of the Board\nFINO Payment Bank has constituted Customer Service Committee of the Board. The members\nof the committee include experts and representatives of the customers as invitees.\nAn illustrative term of reference of the Customer Service Committee is as under:\nCustomer Service Committee, is authorized to perform the following functions:\n1. To formulate comprehensive deposit policy incorporating the issues arising out of the\ndemise of a depositor for operation of his account, the product approval process, the annual\nsurvey of depositor satisfaction and the triennial audit of such services.\n2. To monitor implementation of awards under the Banking Ombudsman Scheme.\n3. To ensure customer are treated fairly all the times and complaints raised by them is dealt\nwith courtesy and in time.\n4. To evaluate feedback on quality of customer service and to oversee implementation of\ncommitments towards customers as per the directions received from BCSBI.', 'text_hash': 'd037e60c0d099ee07223c78107a2f01d', 'quality_score': 0.3088, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'customer_grievance_policy_0', 'normalized_filename': 'customer_grievance_policy_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '785b00f9107f2c85c2912b96e5e471adf57b5ee7ff067aac98d5142dd58ca60b', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 13, 'text_blocks': 13, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:15:44.236550', 'total_chars_post_clean': 30055}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:15:58.185820', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 9, 'chunk_index': 24, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.021312985569238663, 0.0577082633972168, -0.03267473727464676, 0.021150628104805946, 0.050777483731