n• On case-to-case basis, if any complaint is taking more than 30 days to resolve, we will\nsend an interim response to the customer.\n• Within 30 days of lodging a complaint with us, if you do not get a satisfactory response\nfrom us and you wish to pursue other avenues for redressal of grievances, you may\napproach Banking Ombudsman appointed by Reserve Bank of India under the Banking\nOmbudsman Scheme. Our staff would explain the procedure in this regard.\n9.2. Banking Ombudsman Scheme\nWe will display the Banking Ombudsman Scheme and contact details on our branches and\nwebsite.\n9.3. Customers’ meetings', 'text_hash': 'ed28357b4dda8ef4671c9a523ac1c12f', 'quality_score': 0.356, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0', 'normalized_filename': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '5eddba6c22d2fe3b46db023ae68d5183a15cb235b4d6713a96971ab80c02520f', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 11, 'text_blocks': 11, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:28:25.612445', 'total_chars_post_clean': 44536}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:28:37.344849', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 10, 'chunk_index': 21, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.02106655389070511, 0.06309377402067184, -0.020577363669872284, 0.011722509749233723, 0.0451623760163784, -0.0513954758644104, 0.013195443898439407, -0.030266622081398964, 0.002341014565899968, -0.019579699262976646, -0.01687399111688137, 0.013416944071650505, 0.1015516147017479, -0.005507681053131819, -0.03505970537662506, -0.020534269511699677, 0.023784130811691284, -0.0074608507566154, 0.044596511870622635, 0.00148416415322572, 0.0084491902962327, -0.01488583255559206, 0.014175270684063435, -0.046149205416440964, -0.00571743817999959, -0.007075031753629446, 0.00972732249647379, 0.033826958388090134, -0.007021094206720591, 0.059599369764328, 0.020831573754549026, -0.014605807140469551, -0.002