ce of the RBI directions on the subject at the time of opening the accounts. We will\ninform all the customers individually also about our policy on the subject.\n10.2 Reversal Timeline for Zero Liability / Limited Liability\nOn being notified by you, we shall credit (shadow reversal) the amount involved in the\nunauthorized electronic transaction to your account within 10 working days from the date of\nsuch notification by you (without waiting for settlement of insurance claim, if any). The credit\nshall be value dated to be as of the date of the unauthorized transaction. Further, we will\nensure that:', 'text_hash': '7352fa01e60c97953a49c72d885cb843', 'quality_score': 0.3368, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0', 'normalized_filename': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '5eddba6c22d2fe3b46db023ae68d5183a15cb235b4d6713a96971ab80c02520f', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 11, 'text_blocks': 11, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:28:25.612445', 'total_chars_post_clean': 44536}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:28:37.344849', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 11, 'chunk_index': 24, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.020800190046429634, 0.03918309882283211, -0.013866742141544819, 0.01864461973309517, 0.020416731014847755, -0.05778238922357559, -0.010662874206900597, -0.01493295282125473, -0.0009750950848683715, 0.008177722804248333, -0.0048378584906458855, 0.011972064152359962, 0.1118030846118927, 0.013042725622653961, -0.025227852165699005, -0.01651701144874096, 0.04742225259542465, -0.011184259317815304, 0.016041509807109833, 0.0017555790254846215, 0.01941424421966076, -0.037451986223459244, 0.01227023545652628, -0.044463153928518295, 0.00944139901548624, -0.024712849408388138, 0.0013837494188919663, 0.03709261864423752, -0.017335794866085052, 0.04150594398379326, 0.023088587448000908, -0.022164834663271904,