y waiting\nperiod.\nBanking ombudsman- Banking Ombudsman is a quasi-judicial authority functioning under\nIndia\'s Banking Ombudsman Scheme 2006, and the authority was created pursuant to a decision\nmade by the Government of India to enable resolution of complaints of customers of banks\nrelating to certain services rendered by the banks.\nBCSBI- Banking Codes and Standards Board of India\n13', 'text_hash': 'a5600b87c1b3e9af1f72c768c307c837', 'quality_score': 0.3, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'customer_grievance_policy_0', 'normalized_filename': 'customer_grievance_policy_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '785b00f9107f2c85c2912b96e5e471adf57b5ee7ff067aac98d5142dd58ca60b', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 13, 'text_blocks': 13, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:29:17.327348', 'total_chars_post_clean': 30055}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:29:34.290918', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 13, 'chunk_index': 37, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.04642748087644577, 0.06866506487131119, -0.005282118916511536, 0.020934518426656723, 0.04273485392332077, -0.049595147371292114, -0.01252177357673645, -0.020432092249393463, 0.0074939848855137825, 0.030713682994246483, -0.018763067200779915, -0.0001783394254744053, 0.1060938835144043, 0.03138912841677666, -0.04305793344974518, -0.05916498228907585, 0.04090268164873123, -0.012573422864079475, 0.057686399668455124, -0.02124827168881893, 0.023212093859910965, -0.025085201486945152, 0.03542644530534744, -0.027393272146582603, -0.010561634786427021, -0.026560520753264427, -0.0043454342521727085, 0.0025003734044730663, -0.019841337576508522, 0.03148966655135155, 0.02433622069656849, -0.02103087306022644, 0.016685407608747482, 0.03153146058320999, 0.023943763226270676, 0.003936124499887228, -0.0380791537463665, -0.024440823122859, 0.020003901794552803, 0.02734704688191414, 0.014391069300472736, 0.009391918778419495, 0.030642056837677956, -0