anguage. \n• \nEnsuring that our advertising and promotional literature is clear and not misleading. \n• \nEnsuring that you are given clear information about our products and services, the terms \nand conditions and the interest rates/ service charges, which apply to them. \n• \nGiving you information on the facilities provided to you and how you can avail of these \nand whom and how you may contact for addressing your queries. 4.3. \nTo help you use your account or service by: • \nProviding you regular appropriate updates. \n• \nKeeping you informed about changes in the interest rates, charges or terms and conditions. \n•', 'text_hash': '159b1067fa444bcda7b609bd7511a044', 'quality_score': 0.3136, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0', 'normalized_filename': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '5eddba6c22d2fe3b46db023ae68d5183a15cb235b4d6713a96971ab80c02520f', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 11, 'text_blocks': 11, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:47:34.356287', 'total_chars_post_clean': 44536}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:47:53.217862', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 16, 'chunk_index': 34, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.028626807034015656, 0.047946829348802567, 0.008009918965399265, 0.027473583817481995, 0.04131677374243736, -0.04677053540945053, -0.03360533341765404, -0.030746804550290108, 0.0143013009801507, 0.024062974378466606, -0.0034520078916102648, -0.004014530219137669, 0.12724809348583221, 0.019241729751229286, -0.05521253123879433, -0.04287562891840935, 0.03630363196134567, -0.031310852617025375, 0.029055999591946602, -0.002335726749151945, 0.046298813074827194, -0.041416097432374954, 0.0406181700527668, 0.004688721150159836, 0.010180131532251835, -0.0204005129635334, 0.002378439996391535, 0.035704150795936584, -0.009982696734368801, 0.05554516613483429, 0.03181414678692818, -0.0491