 charges applicable to the products \nand services chosen by you. \n• \nWe will also provide you information about the penalties leviable in case of non- \nobservance/violation of any of the terms and conditions governing the product/ services \nchosen by you. Changes in fees & charges If we increase any fee or charge or introduce a new fee or charge, it will be notified through \nstatements of accounts /e-mail /SMS alerts / notice board at branches, one month prior to the \nrevised charges becoming effective. This information will also be made available on our \nwebsite.', 'text_hash': 'ca4e4b2a7ded5639b832dc74885e158d', 'quality_score': 0.3984, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0', 'normalized_filename': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '5eddba6c22d2fe3b46db023ae68d5183a15cb235b4d6713a96971ab80c02520f', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 11, 'text_blocks': 11, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:47:34.356287', 'total_chars_post_clean': 44536}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:47:53.217862', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 18, 'chunk_index': 40, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.019756564870476723, 0.045684851706027985, -0.014128736220300198, 0.012738277204334736, 0.008743931539356709, -0.06252837926149368, -0.0364789217710495, -0.045496612787246704, -0.005872445181012154, 0.025435004383325577, -0.0006032158271409571, -0.012402506545186043, 0.09137742221355438, 0.01808612421154976, -0.03536403924226761, -0.01570119336247444, 0.0317203663289547, 0.0017626590561121702, 0.053104475140571594, -0.010207710787653923, 0.041312944144010544, -0.023463498800992966, 0.0366751030087471, -0.009049036540091038, 0.017136968672275543, -0.04098492115736008, -0.007555091753602028, 0.02527778595685959, -0.006549830082803965, 0.07304124534130096, 0.0358770489692688, -0.035889964550733566, 0.00900942087173462, 0.02587469667