ept / Training Dept\nThese nodal officers will be the first instance with whom RBI and the Banking Ombudsman will\nliaise.\nBanking Ombudsman\nIn case the customer is not satisfied with the response from the Bank, customers will have the\nright of approaching the Banking Ombudsman (BO). The details of BO are made available at the\nbranches and also on the Bank’s website.\n5.3.8 Role and responsibility of various committees/ Nodal officer/ Internal Ombudsman constituted in the\nbank\n• Customer service committee of the Board', 'text_hash': 'a38906d9b703d662f5fd30f7daaa00a8', 'quality_score': 0.3048, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'customer_grievance_policy_0', 'normalized_filename': 'customer_grievance_policy_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '785b00f9107f2c85c2912b96e5e471adf57b5ee7ff067aac98d5142dd58ca60b', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 13, 'text_blocks': 13, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:49:40.018682', 'total_chars_post_clean': 30055}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:49:59.068320', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 9, 'chunk_index': 23, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.04237694293260574, 0.04203217849135399, -0.012189329601824284, 0.03450017049908638, 0.022959714755415916, -0.024035515263676643, -0.031300533562898636, -0.03653695061802864, -0.016752084717154503, 0.004806044045835733, -0.023703714832663536, 0.01786133460700512, 0.12137183547019958, 0.06085330247879028, -0.04136073216795921, -0.024504495784640312, 0.0334906242787838, -0.013502879999577999, 0.04568991810083389, -0.011543963104486465, 0.018172062933444977, -0.01168405544012785, 0.015337159857153893, 0.004359836224466562, 0.038582827895879745, -0.019147023558616638, -0.01037351693958044, 0.0177362859249115, -0.019684113562107086, 0.04613218083977699, 0.034617483615875244, 0.006032296922057867, 0.01777995377779007, 0.02241857349872589, 0.0013356923591345549, 0.055096548050642014, -0.029905561357736588, -0