ically targeted towards improvement of customer\nservice and appropriate actions arising from discussions.\nThe Committee carries out the following specific functions:\n• Evaluate feedback on quality of customer service received\n• Review the practice and procedures prevalent in the bank and take necessary', 'text_hash': 'ac0698f6f9f9038101700f04aa0f38a9', 'quality_score': 0.2728, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'customer_grievance_policy_0', 'normalized_filename': 'customer_grievance_policy_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '785b00f9107f2c85c2912b96e5e471adf57b5ee7ff067aac98d5142dd58ca60b', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 13, 'text_blocks': 13, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:49:40.018682', 'total_chars_post_clean': 30055}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:49:59.068320', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 10, 'chunk_index': 26, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.026963215321302414, 0.02806697227060795, -0.01509295217692852, 0.021884964779019356, 0.020847639068961143, 0.004192969761788845, -0.031215522438287735, -0.021396566182374954, -0.012182519771158695, 0.01040663942694664, -0.023461345583200455, 0.01847553625702858, 0.09228011220693588, 0.03886088356375694, -0.037924908101558685, -0.0269120205193758, 0.03144828975200653, -0.012501738034188747, 0.042309269309043884, -0.013725723139941692, 0.02084500901401043, -0.030310865491628647, 0.027091415598988533, 0.005711541976779699, 0.023859778419137, 0.01087456289678812, -0.020375266671180725, 0.021627597510814667, -0.03245788812637329, 0.027624033391475677, 0.05300532281398773, -0.006737862713634968, 0.013649496249854565, 0.026166900992393494, 0.012648025527596474, 0.02980135753750801, -0.026514727622270584, -0.00434035575017333, 0.025428129360079765, 0.012681342661380768, 0.02267790399491787, 0.057811953127384186, 0.002093214774504304, -0.02657434716820717, -0.00015628278197254986, -0.038170330226421356, 0.03924337401986122, -0