man shall not represent the Bank in legal cases before any court or\nfora or authority.\n• The Internal Ombudsman shall furnish periodic reports (including the analysis of\ncomplaints) on his / her activities to the Committee of the Board handling customer service\nand protection, preferably at quarterly intervals, but not less than half yearly intervals.\n11', 'text_hash': '72d2ecd2244f8cae35de1dd6329c75e6', 'quality_score': 0.4136, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'customer_grievance_policy_0', 'normalized_filename': 'customer_grievance_policy_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '785b00f9107f2c85c2912b96e5e471adf57b5ee7ff067aac98d5142dd58ca60b', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 13, 'text_blocks': 13, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:49:40.018682', 'total_chars_post_clean': 30055}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:49:59.068320', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 11, 'chunk_index': 33, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.026029007509350777, 0.04328488931059837, -0.006703582126647234, 0.023442301899194717, 0.022654062137007713, -0.03242204710841179, -0.019950369372963905, -0.017655353993177414, 0.026695631444454193, 0.018381807953119278, -0.008358637802302837, -0.0006400746642611921, 0.09706798940896988, 0.03175240755081177, -0.04116386920213699, -0.03726966306567192, 0.05103296414017677, -0.025412242859601974, 0.03045017272233963, 0.009478151798248291, 0.03161685913801193, -0.02355935424566269, 0.023659029975533485, -0.016086842864751816, 0.018526185303926468, -0.005863857455551624, -0.005467722192406654, 0.036285459995269775, -0.01607254333794117, 0.04341327026486397, 0.03754514083266258, -0.017979057505726814, 0.005493058357387781, 0.03594072908163071, 0.0044532157480716705, 0.02096339501440525, -0.013995991088449955, 0.009878307580947876, 0.029732173308730125, 0.040163323283195496, 0.026432642713189125, 0.008404138498008251, 0.0063348631374537945, -0.03087271749973297, 0.0033810