unk_id': 'customer_grievance_policy_0_v1_c034', 'chunk_index': 34, 'chunk_type': 'text', 'text': 'The role of Internal Ombudsman is derived from “Master Direction - Reserve Bank of India (Internal\nOmbudsman for Regulated Entities) Directions, 2023” . Any further amendments received from the\nregulatory will be addressed accordingly.\n5.4 Other Instructions\n5.4.1 Mandatory Display of Information\nBranch Display\n• Name and other details of the concerned Nodal Officer appointed under the Banking\nOmbudsman Scheme,2006.\n• The above mentioned details to be updated in case of any changes.\nWebsite Display\n• Names and other details of the officials at the Head Office/Regional Offices/Zonal Offices\nwho can be contacted for redressal of complaints including the names of the Nodal\nOfficers/Principal Nodal Officers. The details of the Principal Nodal Officer needs to be\nprominently displayed in the portal of the bank preferably on the first page of the web- site.\n• Names and other details of the CMD/CEO and also Line Functioning Heads.', 'text_hash': 'd16ef944247747e331fd62be6008d44f', 'quality_score': 0.3504, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'customer_grievance_policy_0', 'normalized_filename': 'customer_grievance_policy_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '785b00f9107f2c85c2912b96e5e471adf57b5ee7ff067aac98d5142dd58ca60b', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 13, 'text_blocks': 13, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:49:40.018682', 'total_chars_post_clean': 30055}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T12:49:59.068320', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 12, 'chunk_index': 34, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.0402691550552845, 0.06238122284412384, -0.01625451073050499, 0.03464130312204361, 0.026010923087596893, -0.05159449204802513, -0.005058666691184044, -0.052635788917541504, -0.023547817021608353, -0.009961244650185108, -0.013397572562098503, 0.0168908778578043, 0.12213762104511261, 0.0516681