led\ne.g. branches, merchants, BC’s, phone, Net banking and tell you how to find out more\nabout them.\n• Tell you what information we need from you to prove your identity and address, for us to\ncomply with legal, regulatory and internal policy requirements.\n• Give you information on your rights and responsibilities especially regarding availing of\nnomination facility offered on all deposit accounts. articles in safe custody and safe deposit\nlockers.\n6.1. ‘Do Not Call’ service', 'text_hash': '4b4b0b0e3183f7d198bfafe05b39fe93', 'quality_score': 0.352, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0', 'normalized_filename': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '5eddba6c22d2fe3b46db023ae68d5183a15cb235b4d6713a96971ab80c02520f', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 11, 'text_blocks': 11, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T13:02:47.537246', 'total_chars_post_clean': 44536}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T13:03:06.853245', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 7, 'chunk_index': 12, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.01012555044144392, 0.04643254727125168, -0.005640743765980005, -0.011549713090062141, 0.04588646814227104, -0.05479807034134865, -0.010822007432579994, -0.038794051855802536, 0.008621759712696075, 0.004905740264803171, -0.00513151939958334, -0.022472549229860306, 0.10300992429256439, 0.007499989587813616, -0.023709414526820183, -0.014812096022069454, 0.022724296897649765, -0.01749238558113575, 0.0481797531247139, -0.024623412638902664, 0.01609090156853199, -0.026516081765294075, 0.017680225893855095, -0.042769767343997955, -0.00757408794015646, -0.030198391526937485, 0.00955365039408207, 0.05057745799422264, -0.015560725703835487, 0.044628869742155075, 0.031394995748996735, -0.03337036445736885, -0.0029680158477276564, 0.028553664684295654, 0.009739341214299202, 0.04206779971718788, 0.00475110299885273, -0.03514538332819