mple language.\nChanges to terms and conditions\n• We will tell you of changes in terms and conditions through any one or more of the\nfollowing channels one month prior to the revised terms and conditions becoming\neffective:\n• Letter\n• Statements of account\n• SMS\n• E-mail\n• Website\nThis information will also be made available on the Notice Boards in our branches and\nour website.\n• Normally, changes will be made with prospective effect giving notice of one month.\n• If we have made any change without notice, we will notify the change within 30 days. If\nsuch change is to your disadvantage, you may within 60 days of the notice, close your', 'text_hash': '530e8b6f34f3d84f3c30f236c8a622dd', 'quality_score': 0.3088, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0', 'normalized_filename': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '5eddba6c22d2fe3b46db023ae68d5183a15cb235b4d6713a96971ab80c02520f', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 11, 'text_blocks': 11, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T13:02:47.537246', 'total_chars_post_clean': 44536}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T13:03:06.853245', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 8, 'chunk_index': 15, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.009380119852721691, 0.06074664741754532, -0.007240296807140112, 0.004639388527721167, 0.03455589339137077, -0.07246647030115128, -0.002195216715335846, -0.02279757522046566, -0.006284050643444061, -0.0017287606606259942, -0.0018248033011332154, 0.006241602823138237, 0.09625637531280518, -0.013456115499138832, -0.030295519158244133, 0.007220442406833172, 0.02829412929713726, -0.003808556357398629, 0.04795696958899498, -0.019765580072999, 0.03141971305012703, -0.007720882073044777, 0.014308659359812737, -0.05055277794599533, -0.0006631516152992845, -0.021469373255968094, 0.017082316800951958, 0.037533387541770935, -0.01613599993288517, 0.04763064533472061, 