y and full details of the relevant terms and conditions will\nbe made available on request.\n• If we avail of the services of third parties for providing support services, we will require\nthat they handle your personal information (if available to such third parties) with the\nsame degree of confidentiality and security as we would.\n• We may, from time to time, communicate to you various features of our products availed\nby you by e-mail, SMS or over the telephone, social media and website. Information\nabout our other products or promotional offers in respect of our products/services will be', 'text_hash': '05b651defc6b664b017df50e971df83f', 'quality_score': 0.3008, 'metadata': {'doc_id': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0', 'normalized_filename': 'code_of_banks_commitment_to_customers_0_v1.pdf', 'content_hash': '5eddba6c22d2fe3b46db023ae68d5183a15cb235b4d6713a96971ab80c02520f', 'extraction_stats': {'total_pages': 11, 'text_blocks': 11, 'table_blocks': 0, 'raw_chars': 0, 'ocr_pages': 0, 'extraction_timestamp': '2026-02-19T13:02:47.537246', 'total_chars_post_clean': 44536}, 'language': 'en', 'has_tables': False, 'cleaned_timestamp': '2026-02-19T13:03:06.853245', 'chunk_type': 'text', 'page_number': 9, 'chunk_index': 18, 'is_table': False}, 'embedding': [0.007779521401971579, 0.04076601564884186, -0.012789127416908741, -0.008400291204452515, 0.05005892738699913, -0.07976764440536499, -0.013368112966418266, -0.023421261459589005, 0.009863425977528095, 0.0018542481120675802, -0.014758458361029625, -0.002768588485196233, 0.09965033084154129, -0.023673616349697113, -0.02583463303744793, -0.002908177673816681, 0.017557982355356216, -0.0058799609541893005, 0.054750412702560425, -0.023027868941426277, 0.028425155207514763, -0.031374603509902954, 0.018767185509204865, -0.04714442789554596, -0.01161376666277647, -0.015315431170165539, 0.03415331616997719, 0.05352132394909859, -0.012936928309500217, 0.06323035806417465, 0.026778046041727066, -0.04019122198224068, -0.00